          "bankId": "05f0020d-5028-478c-ae7e-e74c45a5405a",
          "title": "A New Opportunity",
          "passageHtml": "<p>Maria recently received an opportunity to work in a small international company. The position was available because the company wanted to develop its online services.</p><p>At first, Maria felt nervous because she had never worked with foreign customers before. However, she decided to accept the challenge. She prepared carefully and organized her schedule to balance work and personal responsibilities.</p><p>During her first weeks, she had to answer customer questions, deliver information, and solve simple problems. Sometimes customers complained about delays, but Maria remained patient and focused on finding solutions.</p><p>After several months, she noticed a significant change in her confidence. She could communicate more effectively and manage difficult situations. Her manager encouraged her to continue learning and improving her professional skills.</p><p>Today, Maria enjoys her career much more than before. She believes that every challenge provides a chance to learn something valuable.</p>",
          "passageImageDataUrl": null,
          "mode": "text",
          "instructions": "Read the passage carefully and answer the questions.",
          "vocabSupport": null,
